#n:coherent-contact-sparse-saving","release_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":7,"section_title":"Uniform contact cancellation on an exact injection level","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:3d41e3c6fb9371bc67a353556855a6444b6afb0f502ed217551af41501a4da79","file":"preprints/Routing-densities-and-representation-contraction-for-Thorp-sweeps-September-26-2026/build/sections/06b-contact-cancellation.tex","line":303,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"ee84c49b1fd86c83290928410d7b3b7144dd4c00a5633cd8473b6fac4b3e6a79","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Routing-densities-and-representation-contraction-for-Thorp-sweeps-September-26-2026/build/sections/06b-contact-cancellation.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:3d41e3c6fb9371bc67a353556855a6444b6afb0f502ed217551af41501a4da79","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Routing-densities-and-representation-contraction-for-Thorp-sweeps-September-26-2026/build/sections/06b-contact-cancellation.tex#L303"},"statement_kind":"corollary","text":"\\label{n:coherent-contact-sparse-saving}\nThere are absolute constants $C,d_0>0$ such that for every dyadic\n$n=2^d$ and $\\lambda=(n-k,\\beta)\\vdash n$ satisfying\n$1\\le k<n$ and $\\log(n/k)\\ge d^{3/4}$,\n\\[\n \\|T_n(\\lambda)\\|_{\\op}^2\n \\le e^{Ck}(k/n)^{k/4}.\n\\]\nFor $d\\ge d_0$, the factor $e^{Ck}$ can be omitted."}
